Begin "Verify 'View Inventory' permission"
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Control Panel" sidemenu entry
	Click the "Access" charttab
	Click the "Access Control" charttab subtab
	Type "selenium" in the input
	Click the "Go!" button
	# in the "Username" cell in the "selenium" row in the "WebChart Users" table
	Click the "selenium" link
	# in the "Access Control (selenium)" box
	Verify !exists The "[ View Inventory: No ]" text
Begin "Verify Bug #11352 is fixed"
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Inventory" sidemenu entry
	Click the "Hide Out Of Stock" link
	Verify exists the "Show Out Of Stock" link
	Click the "Show Inventory" charttab
	# Confirm the preference remembered to hide the out of stock items
	Verify exists the "Show Out Of Stock" link
